// luminaria_compose: one frame of composition on vk_gpu. The compositor
// lists placements each frame; the library diffs them into damage, culls
// occluded surfaces, assigns planes, picks the compositor clock's start
// time, never waits on a client fence (an unready buffer shows its last
// frame), holds layout transactions together, and rebuilds after device
// loss. Client buffers are imported and cached as textures here.
